---
/** UK cookies notice (PECR), Glasgow Phase 2. Describes only what the site does today: nothing
 *  that needs consent is set. A build-time guard in BaseLayout refuses a gb town with a GA4 id
 *  until an opt-in-first consent banner exists. Not legal advice. */
import { siteConfig } from '../../../lib/site-config';
---
<article class="prose">
  <h1>Cookies</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated October 2026.</em></p>

  <p>{siteConfig.siteName} does not currently set any analytics or advertising cookies, so there is no cookie
  banner and nothing for you to accept or refuse.</p>

  <p>Cloudflare, our hosting provider, may use a small number of strictly necessary cookies to keep the site
  secure and running smoothly. These are exempt from the consent requirement in the Privacy and Electronic
  Communications Regulations and are not used to track you across other sites.</p>

  <p>Your browser's local storage may hold display preferences such as light or dark mode. These stay on your
  device and are not sent to us.</p>

  <p>If we ever add analytics or advertising, we will ask for your consent before any such cookie is set, make
  refusing as easy as accepting, and update this page first.</p>

  <p>Questions? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>. See also our <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.</p>
</article>

<style>
.prose { max-width: 36rem; }
.prose p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
</style>
